## Retry Configuration

This SDK supports automatic retry for failed requests. Configure retry behavior:

```typescript
const client = new {{.ClientClassName}}({
  baseUrl: '{{.BaseURL}}',
  retryConfig: {
    enabled: true,
    maxAttempts: 3,
    strategy: 'exponential',
    initialDelay: 1000,
    maxDelay: 60000,
  },
});
```
